[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12540.07, "timestamp": "03:29:00", "text": "大约八六个月，就像你知道的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12542.469, "timestamp": "03:29:02", "text": "它能给你带来精神上的提升，你可以去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12544.71, "timestamp": "03:29:04", "text": "见见你的父母，像你一样健康饮食"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12547.349, "timestamp": "03:29:07", "text": "知道吃点东西就回去。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12555.83, "timestamp": "03:29:15", "text": "是的。对我来说，现在差不多11点55分了。哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12558.87, "timestamp": "03:29:18", "text": "已经12岁了。哦，是的。是的。我们谈了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12564.309, "timestamp": "03:29:24", "text": "很多。你必须往右走。是的，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12567.349, "timestamp": "03:29:27", "text": "很高兴能再次联系上你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12570.03, "timestamp": "03:29:30", "text": "知道，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.91, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "很有趣，有很多事情我们应该多做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12577.19, "timestamp": "03:29:37", "text": "将来如果可以的话，我会的，当然可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12579.11, "timestamp": "03:29:39", "text": "我不了解日本和你的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.67, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "日本人让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12584.15, "timestamp": "03:29:44", "text": "我一定会给你发照片的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12587.59, "timestamp": "03:29:47", "text": "还有一些其他的东西，希望你能分享一些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12589.83, "timestamp": "03:29:49", "text": "还有一些来自伦敦的照片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12594.15, "timestamp": "03:29:54", "text": "那意味着“是的，当然可以”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12595.87, "timestamp": "03:29:55", "text": "是的。是的。哦，"}]